## What this rule does not cover

| Need | Use instead |
|------|-------------|
| Safe edits, commits, tests | `cursor-agent-discipline.mdc` |
| HLD/LLD, scale, APIs | `system-design.mdc` |
| CIRCLES + multi-stakeholder verdict | `product-council.mdc` |
| SEO, ads, stack-specific patterns | domain rules in this repo |

**Do not** use Mode A to add features. **Do not** use Modes B/C to override explicit shipped constraints without calling that out.
